000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTOPO.
000400 AUTHOR.         C HILLES / KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MAY 20,1981.
000600*REMARKS.
000600*D               THIS PROGRAM PRODUCES TWO REPORTS. THE FIRST
000700*D               REPORT SHOWS ALL OPEN STOREROOM AND NON-
000800*D               STOREROOM PURCHASE ORDERS THAT ARE GREATER
000900*D               90 CALENDAR DAYS OLD.  THE SECOND REPORT SHOWS
001000*D               ALL BLANKET PURCHASE ORDERS GREATER THAN ONE
001100*D               YEAR OLD.
007400**************************************************************
007500*    USER CAN NOW CHOOSE WHICH CRITERIA SHOULD BE USED IN    *
007600*    DETERMINING WHETHER A PURCHASE ORDER IS TO BE CONSIDERED*
007700*    OPEN.   VALID SELECTIONS ARE:                           *
007800*        A - QUANTITY ORDERED  > QUANTITY RECEIVED           *
007900*        B - QUANTITY RECEIVED > QUANTITY PAID               *
008000*        C - QUANTITY ORDERED  > QUANTITY RECEIVED   'OR'    *
008100*            QUANTITY RECEIVED > QUANTITY PAID               *
008200**************************************************************
008900*C CHANGES
      *C  05/21/92 BK DISMUKES R#6188
      *C      1. ADDED PAGE NUMBER LOGIC TO REPORT OUTPUT
      *C      2. CHANGED ZRSCREEN.FRPTOPO TO ALLOW INPUT FOR RECEIVING
      *C         DEPARTMENT.
      *C      3. ADDED LOGIC TO FILTER BY RECEIVING DEPARTMENT BEFORE
      *C         BEING RELEASED TO SORT IF REQUESTED BY USER.
008900*C
      *C  05/21/92 BK DISMUKES R#5969
008900*C      1. ADDED OPTION TO EXCLUDE NON-RECEIVABLE POS FROM THE
008900*C         REPORT.
008900*C      2. ADDED OPTION TO SELECT POS BY BUYER CODE
      *C      3. CHANGED ZRSCREEN.FRPTOPO TO ALLOW INPUT FOR OPTIONS
008900*C      4. ALL LOGIC ADDED IN 86-MAIN AND DOCUMENTED UNDER
008900*C         REQUEST 6188.
008900*C
008900*C  05/21/92 BK DISMUKES R#5999
008900*C      1. SUPRESSED REPORTING OF "QUANTITY NOT RECEIVED" AND
008900*C         SURPRESSED ZEROS FOR NON-RECEIVABLE POS.  "Q N R"
008900*C         STILL CALCULATES BUT IS FILTERED FOR NON-RECEIVABLE
008900*C         POS.  LOGIC IN 991-WRITE-DETAIL.
008900*C
      *
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *
      *C  10/10/94  CA ZUBEK
      *C      ADDED LOGIC TO EXCLUDE NON-CODED PO'S IF OPTION FROM
      *C      MENU IS CHOSEN.
      *C
      *C  09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON PO DATE AND EXPECT DATE
      *C   COMPARISONS.  ALSO, INCLUDE CENTURY ON SORT
      *C   BY PO DATE.  THE GREGORIAN AND JULIAN DATE
      *C   ROUTINES WERE REPLACE BY JULGREG ROUTINE.
      *C
      *C  06/30/99  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED A COLUMN TO SHOW THE ITEM PRICE AND ADDED AN
      *C   ASTERISK NEXT TO THE PO NUMBER TO INDICATE THAT THE
      *C   PO IS NON-RECEIVABLE.
      *C
      *C   THESE CHANGES ARE FOR PLANTS WHICH ARE EVAULATING
      *C   PURCHASE ORDERS FOR CONVERSION TO SAP R/3 (SYNERGY).
      *C   WHEN NEW PLANTS ARE TO BE ADDED, ADD THE PLANT
      *C   NUMBER TO THE SAP-PLT FIELD.
      *C
      *C  04/11/00  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED VENDOR CODE TO LIST OF REPORT RESTRICTORS.
      *C
      *C  02/20/02  BRUCE GEISER
      *C   CHANGED ITEM COMPLETE CHECK TO LOOK FOR NON-BLANKS.
      *C   COMBINED CHANGES IN MCPRD AND MCTST TO AVOID LOST CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  02/12/04  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED OPTION TO IGNORE THE EXPECT DATE WHEN SELECTING
      *C   PURCHASE ORDERS.
      *C
      *
