011300*  THE TYPE-TRANS-SW FIELD IS DEFINED AS FOLLOWS:            *
011400*                                                            *
011500*    1-- INDICATES AN OPEN PURCHASE ORDER GREATER THAN       *
011600*       'NO-OF-DAYS-OLD'.                                    *
011700*                                                            *
011800*    2-- INDICATES A NON-RECEIVABLE PO WHO HAS EXPIRED       *
011900*        PRIOR TO THE 'NO-OF-DAYS-OLD' DATE.                 *
012000*                                                            *
012100*    3-- INDICATES A BLANKET PURCHASE WHICH HAS EXPIRED      *
012200*        PRIOR TO THE 'REQ-NO-OF-DAYS-OLD' DATE.             *
012300*                                                            *
012400**************************************************************
