051300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA, OPTION-AREA.
051400 0-BEGIN-SORT SECTION.
051500
051600 10-OPEN-FILES.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DPOITEM-I, DVENDOR-I,
                      MBUYER-I.

051700*************************************************************
051800*************************************************************
051900*   ACCEPT TWO LINES OF DATA: 1) ALL HEADER INFORMATION -   *
052000*     WHO AND WHERE THIS REPORT WILL BE ROUTED TO  2) IF    *
052100*     THE REPORT IS TO BE SORTED BY THE HP OR IBM CODE.     *
052200*                                                           *
052300*************************************************************
052400*************************************************************
052500
           DISPLAY "ROUTE-DATA = ", HD-ROUTE-DATA.
052700
052800     DISPLAY "DATA-LINE = ", DATA-LINE.
052900
           MOVE 0                 TO PAGE-CNT.
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"            TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES   TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"           TO OVRPRTF-FILE
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.

053000     OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
053100
