111200*--------------  CRITERIA SELECTION:
111300*--------------    A - COMPARE QTY ORD   TO   QTY DLVR
111400*--------------    B - COMPARE QTY PAID  TO   QTY DLVR
111500*--------------    C - COMPARE QTY ORD   TO   QTY DLVR   AND
111600*--------------                QTY PAID  TO   QTY DLVR
111700*--------------  IF CRITERIA SELECTION IS A OR C, WE COMPARE QTY DLVR
111800*--------------  TO QTY ORD.  IF QTY DLVR < QTY ORD, PO IS CONSIDERED
111900*--------------  OPEN.
